# ACC3D PRODUCTION deck run12 (2026-10-22, USER decisions via coordinator): = D_B1v6.athinput.in (vphi_acc_1021, md5 e8ae9b7d) with @FILES@ -> /raven/ptmp/jinma/acc3d_1017/run,
# <rad_m1>/time2_vet_col = extrap2 for the WHOLE run (USER 10-22: static +3 %, stream +7.6 %; no key switch in the chain). Needs the fin51-r-fix tip with extrap2 (c92d5b03 + extrap2). + <rad_m1>/implicit_face_opac = harmonic (USER 10-22; needs the faceopac-prod-1022 tip).
# debug outputs m1_vet/m1_face (dt 1e30) dropped (= prod outputs). Mesh/meshblock/time/outputs = acc3d_prod_v12lzc_be_gm. Binary: fin51-r-fix tip after c92d5b03 (prod-extrap2-1022).
# D_B1v6 (vphi-1021, 2026-10-21, USER GO via coordinator): = hold_acc_1021/decks/D_B1.athinput (md5 345d380241f0326497a5b025b7fd53ed)
# + problem/stream_nsig = 6 + problem/stream_rad_nsig = 3.  Reason: the 3-sigma nozzle held its edge gas ~1e5x
# above the floor pressure beside it; HLLC put that pressure on floor-density cells (up to vceil 1000 km/s in one
# cycle).  At 6 sigma the held Gaussian reaches the floor.  The stream radiation and the neck lobe-rule light stay
# on the optically thick 3-sigma window.  NEEDS branch vphi-1021 f852977b (= 599c8f7d + the neck light on the
# radiation window; 599c8f7d alone holds the neck light out to 6 sigma: Ltop +6 %).
# ACC3D deck v12lzc_prodrad (vetgd-acc-1021 follow-up 2): acc3d_prod_v12lzc_be_gm (5de0635e) with <rad_m1> :=
# rsg_E_start1020r_clip <rad_m1> (accretor units/floor/BC keys kept, ACC-marked), prod hydro switches, prod dt_retry keys.
# ACC3D PRODUCTION deck v11amwtr (= v11amw + <hydro>/nscalars = 2 + scalars_rst_missing = zero; acctrc-1019 4960ac49 on accwall 4d2d5628, 10-19)
# ACC3D PRODUCTION deck v11am (= acc3d_prod_v11 + <hydro>/am_transport = true; ACCV11 10-19)
# ACC3D PRODUCTION deck, MESA-KAP (USER 10-18: 3-D massive-star setups use MESA kap) (acc3d-1017, 10-18): branch accretor-3d-1017 code 5bc6c3b4 (bin v7; v10 deck: + stream_sector_light = surface + env_ic_vz, branch accretor-3d-stream-1018). 3-D (+-20.4 deg) sp wedge 420 x 58 x 512 with
# phys_3d (3-D Roche gravity, Coriolis, 3-D equipotential IC), hse theta walls + imposed equilibrium (von Zeipel) lateral
# radiative flux; run by jobs/prod_chain.sbatch (static phase to t 0.05, then stream on, tlim 1e9). The older header below
# (the half-resolution benchmark / band text) is historical.
# =====================================================================================
# Plaskett's-star progenitor at the start of Case-A accretion (Wade et al. 2026,
# arXiv:2609.25526): the L1 stream on a RESOLVED envelope of the gainer
# (ry_per_accretor, problem/inner = envelope).  DeltaAI setup 2026-10-07 (env13).
# Ideal gas gamma 5/3; the envelope is an n = 3 polytrope in the Roche potential
# (spin 1), anchored at the photospheric P/rho = c_ph^2 on the equipotential through
# R_acc (phi 90); temperatures relaxed with env_t_relax (stream effectively isothermal).
# Code: branch accretor-1007 (env_top_mode, env_wb_depth, r_meas).
# Derivations: plaskett_setup_1007.py / RESULTS.md (DeltaAI scratch setup/), audit 10-07.
# S3a (accretor-rhd-1008): <rad_m1> on the static envelope (stream off), env_ic = column.
# S5 (accretor-rhd-1008, user 10-09): P = 3.81 d (Wade+2026 Sect. 5) -> a 33.2596, d_L1 16.2266,
#   r_out 13.7926, new grid (plaskett_setup_1009.py, rhd/s5/setup/setup_1009.out), S0 column
#   rebuilt (column_z0.02_p381.txt), band factor 0.963286; PHYSICAL AMBIENT (env_amb_mode =
#   radeq: floor gas at radiative equilibrium, absorption on, no T relaxation, floor booked);
#   HOT OPTICALLY THICK STREAM (one-zone state at r_out from stream_physics_1009.py, Ryu+2025
#   adiabatic Q 0.649, launch at c_T(L1) 45.45 km/s) with its radiation injected (stream_rad).
#   Derivation: docs/dev/accretor_rhd/plaskett_s5_1009.md.
# UNITS: length Rsun, velocity km/s, time 6.957e5 s (P_orb = 0.458266), density in units
# of the stream's peak density at r_out (problem/rho_stream).
# Temperatures from Wade+2026's MESA track at the onset of Case A (HR figure):
#   gainer Teff 28.3 kK (log L 4.73), donor Teff 26.2 kK (log L 4.84, R = R_L 12.8).
# Stream: Ryu et al. 2025 (arXiv:2505.18255) isothermal L_in solution at L1, carried to
#   r_out with its local transverse pressure-supported width; Mdot 1e-4 Msun/yr.
# =====================================================================================
# accretor-3d-1016: 3-D (+-20 deg) HALF-RESOLUTION BENCHMARK deck derived from the bigdom
# handover deck (b145): 420 x 114 x 1024 = 49,029,120 cells on 4 H200 (4 MeshBlocks 420x114x256).
# Forces/IC/WB are the band's (theta-invariant): a cost and plumbing benchmark, not physics.
<comment>
problem = Plaskett progenitor, start of Case-A accretion, resolved envelope (env13: equipotential top, Ryu+2025 stream, Wade+2026 temperatures)

<job>
basename = ryper

<mesh>
nghost = 3   # ACC: prod value; FOFC + plm needs 3 ghost zones (hydro.cpp:416) (prod 2)
nx1       = 420   # 3-D benchmark: half resolution of the 840-cell bigdom grid (old 640 -> 320 + tail)
x1min     = 6.3
x1max     = 24.33996                 # bigdom-1015: 1.5 d_L1 (d_L1 16.22664, P 3.81 d); was 13.7926
ix1_bc    = user
ox1_bc    = user
nx2       = 58   # acc3d-1017 static test: +-29 cells of dtheta = dphi = 2 pi/512 (+-20.39 deg)
x2min     = 1.2149127840
x2max     = 1.9266798696
ix2_bc    = user   # acc3d-1017 arm H: closed hydrostatic theta walls (pgen theta_bc = hse)
ox2_bc    = user
nx3       = 512   # acc3d-1017: quarter of the full-res phi count (dt is set radially)
x3min     = 0.0
x3max     = 6.283185307179586
ix3_bc    = periodic
ox3_bc    = periodic
use_spherical_polar = true
# plateau radial stretch (plaskett_setup_1009.py, NX1=640, P 3.81 d): fine zone 8.756..9.598 at
# dr <= H_p/4 (H_p,min 0.0102 at c_ph 19.41), covering the tidally bulged photosphere
# (r_ph 9.00 at phi 90 .. 9.445 at phi 0); face 218 = r_acc; neighbour ratio <= 1.095
use_grid_stretch_r_poly = true
f_stretch_r_c1 = 0.0
f_stretch_r_c2 = 0.0
f_stretch_r_c3 = 0.0
f_stretch_r_c4 = 0.0
f_stretch_r_p_amp = -2.1938589633103867
f_stretch_r_p_xa = 0.13152342165045811
f_stretch_r_p_xb = 0.77203350400482496
f_stretch_r_p_w = 0.018749999999999999
# bigdom-1015 (design sect. 13): the 640-cell grid above is kept face for face up to its face
# 520 (r 10.4157), then a log tail (face ratio 1.002656, old grid 1.002675 there) to x1max
f_stretch_r_tail_nin= 320   # the half-resolution old grid: every other face of the 640-cell map
f_stretch_r_tail_x1max = 13.7926
f_stretch_r_tail_ij= 260   # junction face 260 = old 520 (r 10.4157)

<meshblock>
nx1       = 420
nx2       = 58
nx3       = 64    # PROD: 8 MeshBlocks = 8 A100 (2 Raven nodes x 4)

<time>
dt_retry = true
evolution  = dynamic
integrator = rk2
cfl_number = 0.3
nlim      = -1
tlim      = 1.0e9   # PROD (long-tlim rule): run until walltime, restart chain; static phase = override in jobs/prod_chain.sbatch
dt_min     = 1.0e-8                  # PROD: USER 10-18 fallback for the stream-contact eint<=0 retries (1e-7 = FATAL in 2-D)
ndiag     = 50
dt_retry_fac_t2 = 0.9   # ACC: prod retry key
dt_retry_grow = 1.1   # ACC: prod retry key
dt_retry_ngood = 20   # ACC: prod retry key

<units>
length_cgs = 6.957e10                # Rsun
time_cgs   = 6.957e5                 # Rsun/(km/s)
mass_cgs   = 1.7205983e25            # rho_u Rsun^3, rho_u = 5.11e-8 g/cc (env13 stream peak, unit choice a)
mu         = 1.0                     # general EOS: T_unit = m_u (km/s)^2/k_B = 120.27 K

<hydro>
eos             = general            # tabulated general EOS (Saha H/He), gas only
general_eos     = table
gamma           = 1.6666666666666667
eos_h2          = false
eos_ionization  = true
eos_metal_ionization = false
eos_radiation   = false              # S3: <rad_m1> evolves E
eos_xh          = 0.70
eos_yhe         = 0.28               # Z = 0.02
eos_logd_min    = -18.0              # dfloor 1e-8 code = 5.1e-16 g/cc
eos_logd_max    = 0.0
eos_logt_min    = 3.5
eos_logt_max    = 7.6                # impact shocks; the hot ambient is gone (S5)
eos_dlog        = 0.02
reconstruct     = plm
rsolver         = hllc
dfloor          = 1.0e-8             # = problem/rho_amb
pfloor          = 1.0e-10
tfloor_kelvin   = 5.0e3
etotgrav        = true
wellbalance_dynamic = true
wb_x1           = true
wb_option       = polytropic
wb_rho          = true
am_transport    = true   # ACCV11 10-19 (USER: AM conservation at a link boundary): exact L_z (orbital axis = sp polar axis) transport
                         # correction of the hydro (hydro_am.hpp, T_cons - T_code); needs prodmerge-1019 + amdtr-1019 (ab758e94). No frame_omega
                         # (the pgen's phys_3d Coriolis + Roche-centrifugal about the CM stays), no am_vector (wedge walls: Lx, Ly not conserved),
                         # implicit_am_cs is cubed-sphere only.
nscalars        = 2      # ACCTRC 10-19 (USER): passive tracers, s0 = STREAM (nozzle gas), s1 = BOUNDARY INFLOW (gas entering through
                         # r_in / r_out / the theta walls); floor mass carries s = 0. Needs acctrc-1019 (4960ac49+). hydro_w bins
                         # gain s_00, s_01; diagnostics in ryper.trc.hst (ryper.user.hst unchanged).
scalars_rst_missing = zero   # ACCTRC: a restart from a file written WITHOUT scalars (link 1 rst) reads the hydro variables and starts
                         # s0 = s1 = 0; ignored when the file has nscalars = 2 (link 3 on), any other mismatch is FATAL
rad_signal_speed = true   # ACC: prod switch
fofc = true   # ACC: prod switch
fofc_report = 512   # ACC: prod switch
fofc_report_dt = 5.1746e-3   # ACC: prod 3.6e3 s in code time (6.957e5 s)
dfloor_keep_velocity = true   # ACC: prod switch
vceil = 1000.0   # ACC: prod 1e8 cm/s = 1000 km/s code
wb_cache_every = 0   # ACC: prod switch

<rad_m1>
implicit_hold = true   # hold_acc_1021 arm B1
implicit_cs2_clip = rad   # cs2clip-1020 (USER 10-20): limiter clip not booked as gas momentum (floor-gas kick fix)
# DROPPED (cubed-sphere only): implicit_am_cs = true   # amdef-1019 coordinator 10-19: cs gas+radiation L_z (named explicitly)
vet_gd_twin_state        = trans          # FIN3 (prodswitch-1013, fin3-1012)
vet_rotate_avg           = 4              # FIN3 (prodswitch-1013, fin3-1012)
vet_gd_twin_weight       = none           # FIN3 (prodswitch-1013, fin3-1012)
vet_interp               = auto           # FIN3 (prodswitch-1013, fin3-1012)
vet_col_lat_cut_thin     = 1.0            # FIN3 (prodswitch-1013, fin3-1012)
implicit_predictor_frozen = false          # FIN3: UN #10 dropped (frozen predictor costs Cartesian T-ladder order; inert on sp). coordinator 2026-10-13, reported to user
vet_bc_inner             = auto           # FIN3 (prodswitch-1013, fin3-1012)
vet_bc_reflect           = auto           # FIN3 (prodswitch-1013, fin3-1012)
implicit_hr_face_gd      = none           # FIN3 (prodswitch-1013, fin3-1012)
implicit_thin_js_face    = hcface         # jsfix 8bfeae8c, d3bf42d7 final method (user 2026-10-12)
vet_gd_rotate_slope      = correct        # d3bf42d7 final method (user 2026-10-12)
vet_gd_rotate_stretch    = 0.02           # one method: = BSG and fresh default (user 2026-10-12)
vet_gd_rotate_t0         = 0.0            # final_1012
vet_gd_rotate_align      = true           # final_1012
vet_gd_rotate_dt = auto   # ACC: 20 x first dt (prod value is in RSG seconds) (prod 2.2e4)
time2_start              = be             # final_1012
time2_vet_sc             = predict        # final_1012
implicit_vimp_bc         = true           # final_1012
implicit_cs2_shift       = false          # final_1012
implicit_cs2_hll         = drag           # final_1012
time2_vet_col_source     = blend          # final_1012
vet_gd_symref            = col            # final_1012
implicit_thin_hcface_gd  = x1             # final_1012
implicit_thin_hcface     = tau            # final_1012
implicit_thin_bq_gd      = cell           # final_1012
implicit_thin_js_gd      = x1             # final_1012
implicit_thin_hcsf       = j              # final_1012
implicit_hr_excess       = none           # prodfinal-1011
time2_pred_cap           = 0.5            # final_1012
implicit_gas_src         = conservative2  # final_1012
vet_seg                  = jump           # final_1012
ic_rad                   = fs_relax       # prodfinal-1011
vet_bc_diff              = face           # final_1012
implicit_thin_corr       = hc             # final_1012
implicit_thin_switch     = fse            # final_1012
time2_vstage             = true           # final_1012
vet_gd_twin_fuse         = true   # accel-1009: twin in the main sweep (restart-exact cut, -15 %/cycle)
vet_gd_twin_det          = true   # accel-1009: fixed-order twin shell means (GPU run-to-run bitwise)
# rc-1009 keys (fixbundle-1009 beded6c6 + rad-beam-1008 twin): on
vet_source_noesrc        = true   # F1: never without vet_gd_twin
vet_gd_twin              = true   # with F1 (beam worker A3d twin, 10-09)
vet_scatter              = true   # Ma+2026 split, kappa_es from the EOS (user 10-09)
vet_scatter_form         = ma
vet_scatter_j            = relaxed
vet_scatter_kappa_e      = eos
implicit_face_opac_n     = true   # F2
implicit_pos_floor_solve = true   # F3 (needs implicit_pos_floor = true)
implicit_tsolve_opac = true
implicit_tsolve_opac_mode = 1
implicit_gas_newton_switch = 10
implicit_thin_freeze = 1.0e-2
implicit_realisable_coupling = true
report_newton_fb = false   # rc-1009: no per-step iw host copy (accel worker, -19 %/cycle; F4 counters keep the count)
c_light = 299792.458   # ACC: accretor-specific (units / floor / BC) (prod 2.99792458e10)
arad = 3.0981247e-09   # ACC: accretor-specific (units / floor / BC) (prod 1.583122e-46)
chat_over_c      = 1.0
closure          = vet_col
vet_gd           = true
vet_gd_replace   = true
vet_col_lat_taucut = 30.0
vet_gd_gl_nmu    = 10
vet_gd_gl_nphi   = 12               # 2 pi/12 divides the phi period pi/3
vet_gd_gl_stagger = true
vet_gd_rotate_every = 10
vet_col_lat_offdiag = operator       # T5wihc
vet_gd_tangential   = false
vet_gd_wall_interp  = true
vet_gd_halo_compact = 2
implicit_halo_direct = true
implicit_od_cache = true
implicit_krylov_fuse = 1
implicit_op_stencil = true
implicit_precond = mg                 # accel-1009: mg (A -17 %, B -21 %; within the Picard-tolerance noise, 218-cycle B)
implicit_halo_mpi = true
implicit_halo_overlap = true
opacity = table   # ACC: accretor-specific (units / floor / BC) (prod table)
temp_unit_kelvin = 120.272355   # ACC: accretor-specific (units / floor / BC) (prod 1.202724e-8)
rho_unit_cgs = 5.1099127e-08   # ACC: accretor-specific (units / floor / BC) (prod 1.0)
kappa_unit = 3554.96626   # ACC: accretor-specific (units / floor / BC) (prod 1.0)
e_floor = 1.0e-10   # ACC: accretor-specific (units / floor / BC) (prod 1.0e-4)
coupling         = true
gas_feedback     = true
force_reference  = wb_arad
force_reference_work = split
transport        = implicit
implicit_solver  = bicgstab
implicit_offdiag = auto
implicit_closure_lag = step
implicit_lin_maxit = 200
implicit_lin_tol = 1.0e-10
implicit_lin_cnorm = 1.0e-10
implicit_tol     = 1.0e-8
implicit_resid_fatal = 1.0e-2
implicit_maxit   = 200
implicit_one_pass = 0
implicit_opac_update = true
implicit_opac_newton = true
implicit_opac_newton_guard_mode = 6
implicit_opac_newton_slope_max = 3          # opacity-cliff damping (H/He recombination; He giant fix 90a1d462), user 10-08
implicit_gas_newton = true
implicit_flux    = blend          # hrup-1009 a5de361a half-range VET (BLENDALL.md idort_f36 x30)
implicit_flux_faces = all
implicit_flux_beam  = halfrange
implicit_blend   = idort_f
implicit_blend_tau0  = 1
implicit_blend_alpha = 1
implicit_blend_flo   = 0.3
implicit_blend_fhi   = 0.6
implicit_blend_xthin     = 0              # final_1012
implicit_enthalpy = plm
implicit_vimp            = true           # final_1012
implicit_predictor = step
implicit_lin_ew_max = 1.0e-2
implicit_closure_thin_relax = 1.5
implicit_g0_exchange = true
implicit_g0_limit = 1.0
implicit_pos_gas = true
implicit_pos_floor = true
time_scheme              = hesdirk2       # final_1012
vet_col_every    = 1
time2_vet_col            = extrap2        # run12 USER 10-22: extrap2 (was predict, final_1012)
implicit_face_opac       = harmonic       # run12 USER 10-22: face opacity harmonic (faceopac-prod-1022)
time2_reject             = retry          # USER 10-20 option (c): non-admissible hesdirk2 stage -> dt_retry at a smaller dt (2nd order kept) instead of backward Euler (t2retry-1020)
marshak_q        = 0.5
implicit_bc_x1min = flux   # ACC: accretor-specific (units / floor / BC) (prod flux)
implicit_flux_x1min = 1399683.58   # ACC: accretor-specific (units / floor / BC) (prod 1.754459175000e+13)
implicit_bc_x1max = marshak   # ACC: accretor-specific (units / floor / BC) (prod marshak)
implicit_flux_x1max = 0.0   # ACC: accretor-specific (units / floor / BC) (prod 0.0)
# ---- prodfinal-1011: every remaining key named at the binary default (PAR_DUMP of a fresh run)
cfl_rad                          = 0.4
subcycle                         = 1
thick_flux                       = none
ap_form                          = alpha2
scaled_prefactor                 = 20
kappa_p                          = 0
kappa_e                          = 0
kappa_f                          = 0
kappa_s                          = 0
rho_ref                          = 1
t_ref                            = 1
opac_a                           = 0
opac_b                           = 0
vet_kappa_es                     = 0.34
vet_kappa_floor                  = 1e-05
advect_split                     = 0
split_vel                        = recon
source_form                      = full
f_source                         = cell
opac_freeze                      = 0
dbg_gas_force                    = 1
